{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc1d-come a Pro!</strong><br>A tiny, high-speed clicker built to sharpen your hand-eye coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Compete with players around the world!</strong><br>Yes, you heard that right! Your score is automatically ranked on the global leaderboard for everyone to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>1-minute rounds \u2014 it\u2019s easy to start, hard to stop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How to Play:</strong><br>\ud83d\udc1d Smaller bees = bigger points<br>\u23f1 The faster you click, the higher the score<br>\ud83c\udf3b Every 3 bees = Sunflower spawn<br>\ud83d\udc1e Kill the black beetle before it steals your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcca <strong>Analyze your performance</strong><br>Review your past games and spot your peak moments!<br>Use detailed graphs to track progress and see how your skills improve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1d <strong>Made for everyone!</strong><br>Whether you\u2019re here to train your aim or just want a quick, satisfying challenge, <i>Bee Pro</i> is simple, addictive, and perfect for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666950?t=1745245762","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666950/4e7bbe9e01aa1f170843bdcbc42d0c2524e9c1ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745245762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666950/08f1dbc234e35aa530221f00078432348c55ab96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745245762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666950/08f1dbc234e35aa530221f00078432348c55ab96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745245762","categories":[{"descriptio